ar?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Char\">Char</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cur</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor\">InlineCursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Subslice.html#String.Slice.Subslice\">Subslice</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor\">InlineCursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `cur` begins with `c`, returns that character as a subslice together with `cur` advanced past it.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor.parseChar?","kind":"def","line":136,"name":"Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor.parseChar?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.lean#L136-L143"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">partial def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor.skipWhile\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">InlineCursor</span>.<span class=\"name\">skipWhile</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cur</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor\">InlineCursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Char\">Char</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor\">InlineCursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Advances past the characters at the start of `cur` that satisfy `p`.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor.skipWhile","kind":"opaque","line":112,"name":"Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor.skipWhile","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.lean#L112-L134"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor.parseLineEnding?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">InlineCursor</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseLineEnding?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cur</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor\">InlineCursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span