\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A cursor into an `InlineSource`, analogous to a slice of a `String`. It consists of the current\nposition, the end of the input, and the index of the line that contains the current position. A\nparser that is given a cursor reads the text from the current position to the end of the input and\nnothing else.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor","kind":"structure","line":28,"name":"Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.lean#L28-L51"}}],"imports":["Init.Data.Array.Basic","Init.Data.String.OrderInstances","Init.Omega","Init.While","Lean.Data.Markdown.Inline","Lean.Data.Markdown.InlineSource"],"instances":[{"className":"Inhabited","name":"Lean.Markdown.instInhabitedInlineCursor","typeNames":["Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor"]}],"name":"Lean.Data.Markdown.InlineCursor"}